. * HYPOTHESIS TEST FOR H3 * (Please adapt according to your needs)
. 
.         * Please add a verbal description of your model here
. 
.         * We consider the variable housework_difference a suitable measure of
>  support 
.         * for gender equality. It measures the absolute difference in hourse 
> that 
.         * couples spend on household chores and childecare, where a zero indi
> cates 
.         * gender equality and more positive values represent greater inequali
> ty. 
.         * To estimate the effect of having at least one daughter on gender eq
> uality 
.         * in households, we conduct an instrumental variable (IV) estimation 
> using 
.         * linear OLS regression. Specifically, we instrument the variable Has
> Daughter 
.         * with first_daughter that indicates if the first born child is a dau
> ghter.
. 
.         
.                 ivreg2 housework_difference (has_daughter = first_daughter) $
> controls if parental_age >= 10, robust first

